# WireMesh relay configuration (systemd EnvironmentFile).
# The relay is argv-configured: <bind-addr> <cert-dir> --controller <sync-host:port>
# Its identity (cert/key/ca, each mode 0600) must be enrolled into the cert dir
# first (see `wiremesh-relay-enroll` / docs/install.md).
RELAY_ARGS=0.0.0.0:4443 /var/lib/wiremesh --controller CONTROLLER_HOST:9500
